Licensing summary
=================

This repository is released under two licences:

  - Source code (the *.py pipeline, tests and scripts) is licensed under the
    MIT License, reproduced in full below.

  - Releasable documentation and aggregate materials (everything under
    supplement/, Figures 1-5 in outputs/figures/, and the metadata/
    dictionaries) are licensed under the Creative Commons
    Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC-BY-4.0),
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/.

  - Raw survey responses and open-text answers are NOT part of this repository
    and are not released, for participant-privacy reasons (see README and the
    data-availability statement). No data licence applies to them.

When reusing material from this repository, cite it as described in CITATION.cff.

